ocked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":7,"created_at":"2024-10-21T21:30:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T18:20:09Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T18:19:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98396.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-18T18:19:40Z"},"body":"This PR fixes a crash in several generators, preventing compilation through CS8785.\r\n\r\nTo filter read-only properties, we currently check if the property is read-only (duh), or is its set method is init-only. In reality, we cannot take for granted the fact a set method is available to check, even when the property is not read-only. This is because C# allows the following.\r\n\r\n```cs\r\nclass Foo\r\n{\r\n    // Define a readable, and writable property as virtual\r\n    public virtual string MyString\r\n    {\r\n        get;\r\n        set;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\nclass Bar : Foo\r\n{\r\n    // Only override the get accessor\r\n    public override string MyString\r\n    {\r\n        get { return \"Gotcha\"; }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nSince we assume we have a set method to check, we're raising an NRE when checking for the init-only flag. To fix this, we're now recursing on the overridden property if it makes sense.\r\n\r\nCheers :v:\r\n\r\n- _Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/71102_","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api